**Single-owner areas: Troy Goode owns most of the library and its tests. Douglas Christopher Wilson owns HISTORY.md and the config files.**

I used `git blame -w -M -C`, ignoring the formatting-only commit `62628c0` (by "Fiona Formatter"), because it would otherwise take credit for reformatted lines. I counted "Troy Goode" under both of their emails as one person. The history has 354 commits.

| Area | Top owner | Share of lines | Risk |
